OL,3,GNEWSAMajor disruption as grass fire
OL,4,Ahalts all trains to Heathrow Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrains to and from Heathrow Airport
OL,7,Fhave been halted after a trackside
OL,8,Fgrass fire caused delays and
OL,9,Fcancellations.
OL,11,FNational Rail said "major disruption"
OL,12,Fwas expected until the end of Saturday
OL,13,Ffollowing the incident which began
OL,14,Fshortly after 16:00 BST.
OL,16,FA statement said all lines were blocked
OL,17,Fbetween London Paddington station and
OL,18,FHeathrow's terminals, as well as
OL,19,FReading, due to "a failure of the
OL,20,Felectricity supply caused by a fire
OL,21,Fnext to the track".
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
