OL,3,GNEWSAMajor disruption as grass fire
OL,4,Ahalts all trains to Heathrow Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn update from Network Rail Western
OL,7,Flate on Saturday said the fire had been
OL,8,Fextinguished, but warned that
OL,9,Fdisruption would continue, possibly
OL,10,Finto Sunday morning for some services.
